# Ownership for review routing: pull requests touching these paths automatically
# request review from the owner.
#
# NOTE on the ruleset: `require_code_owner_review` must stay OFF while there is a
# single owner. GitHub does not count a code owner's approval of their own pull
# request, so with one owner who authors everything the requirement can never be
# satisfied and every PR deadlocks. Turn it on when there is a second maintainer.

